<title>USA: AMEX to trade options on B.A.T..</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade options on B.A.T..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Thursday it will trade options on the AMEX-listed American Depositary Shares of B.A.T. Industries P.L.C. beginning July 23.</p>
<p>B.A.T. will open with strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20, and position limits of 7,500 contracts, AMEX said. Initial expiration months will be August, September and October of 1997 and January of 1998, it said.</p>
<p>Specialist for the new options will be Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg, it said.</p>
</text>
